   "he": "אָכַל חֵלֶב וָחֵלֶב בְּהֶעְלֵם (אַחַת) [אֶחָד]. מַתְקֵיף לַהּ רַבִּי זֵירָא: אַמַּאי אֵינוֹ חַיָּיב אֶלָּא חַטָּאת אַחַת וְהָא שְׁנֵי זֵיתֵי חֵלֶב אָכַל!",
   "en": "§ The mishna teaches that if one unwittingly «ate» an olive-bulk of forbidden «fat and» then ate another olive-bulk of forbidden «fat during one lapse of awareness,» he is liable to bring only one sin offering. «Rabbi Zeira objects to this: Why is he liable» to bring «only one sin offering? But didn’t he eat two olive-bulks of» forbidden «fat?»"
  }
